  "extract": "Carrier Strike Group 10, is a U.S. Navy carrier strike group. As of August 2022, CSG-10 consists of USS George H.W. Bush (CVN-77), the strike group's current flagship, with Carrier Air Wing Seven embarked on board, and ships of Destroyer Squadron 26.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Carrier Strike Group 10</b>, is a U.S. Navy carrier strike group. As of August 2022, CSG-10 consists of <span>USS <i>George H.W. Bush</i> (CVN-77)</span>, the strike group's current flagship, with Carrier Air Wing Seven embarked on board, and ships of Destroyer Squadron 26.</p>"
